## Smart Schedule & Reliability Upgrade — complete

Both modules are implemented in the existing architecture, tested on an isolated instance on port 3100, and documented. The running production process on port 3000 was not restarted or interrupted; it still serves the previous server code until you restart normally.

### Module 1 — Smart Daily Schedule

- **Four programming modes**: Morning Prayer, Afternoon Bible Study, Evening Worship, Night Prayer, covering the full day (Night wraps midnight).
- **Seven US timezones** with IANA ids, default `America/Chicago`. Wall-clock boundaries come from `Intl.DateTimeFormat`, so DST and midnight transitions need no hardcoded offsets.
- Each program drives prayer themes, tagged Scripture selection, quiz cadence, narration pace, music categories, background categories, welcome/gift/community settings. It reuses the existing show, quiz, music and stage engines.
- Transitions are signature-based, so a boundary, an override start and an override expiry each fire **exactly once**. Switching never restarts TikTok, the show timer or playback.
- **Manual override** runs a program for 15–120 minutes then returns to the schedule automatically. **Preview** applies content without creating an override.
- Editing one program's start/end automatically moves the neighbour's shared boundary, keeping the day continuous.
- The 20 KJV verses now carry tags (`morning`, `comfort`, `night`, `strength`, …) so each mode draws relevant Scripture.

### Module 2 — Reliability & Auto Recovery

- **Piper recovery**: unexpected exits, spawn failures, readiness timeout and synthesis timeouts are detected; worker restarts with 2s → 5s → 10s → 30s → 60s backoff, pending speech is rejected once (never replayed), 8 restarts/hour pauses retries, and **Retry Piper** resets the limit. Generated WAV files are checked for a silent payload.
- **TikTok reconnect**: single-flight connections, exponential backoff, reuse of the configured @username, 30s stale-socket watchdog, 2-minute hung-connect detection, auth/captcha/session errors pause retries for an admin, and listeners/gift combos are reset per session so stale events are not replayed.
- **CPU / RAM / event-loop monitoring** with sustained thresholds (CPU 80%/60s and 95%/30s; RAM 80%/60s and 90%/30s; loop 200ms/1000ms). No component is killed because of load.
- **Music integrity**: read-only checks for missing entries, path escapes, unreadable files, invalid containers, duplicate ids and orphans. Refreshing the manifest keeps a backup and never deletes audio.
- **Silent audio detection**: the OBS stage reports music-bus RMS every 15s. Three silent reports while music should be audible raise an incident and send `audio.recover`, which reloads the same track without a second player. Paused/disabled/ducked/narration states and unmeasured levels are never false positives.
- **Health dashboard** with nine status indicators, metrics, recovery controls, incident history and a sanitised diagnostic export.

### Admin dashboard

New **Smart Daily Schedule** and **System Health & Auto Recovery** panels, plus auto-reconnect controls in the TikTok panel.

![Smart Daily Schedule panel](docs/screenshots/admin-smart-schedule.png)

![System Health & Auto Recovery panel](docs/screenshots/admin-system-health.png)

### Files

**Created:** [lib/schedule.js](lib/schedule.js), [lib/health.js](lib/health.js), [lib/music-integrity.js](lib/music-integrity.js), [config/schedule.json](config/schedule.json), [scripts/test-reliability.js](scripts/test-reliability.js), [admin-smart-schedule.png](docs/screenshots/admin-smart-schedule.png), [admin-system-health.png](docs/screenshots/admin-system-health.png).

**Modified:** [server.js](server.js), [lib/show.js](lib/show.js), [config/messages.en.json](config/messages.en.json), [public/admin.html](public/admin.html), [public/css/admin.css](public/css/admin.css), [public/js/admin.js](public/js/admin.js), [public/js/audio.js](public/js/audio.js), [public/js/live.js](public/js/live.js), [scripts/smoke-test.js](scripts/smoke-test.js), [README.md](README.md).

**Backups:** `backup/pre-reliability-20261101-005133/` contains the previous `server.js`, `lib/show.js`, `config/config.js`, `config/app.config.json`, `public/admin.html`, `public/js/admin.js`, `public/js/audio.js` and `scripts/smoke-test.js`. `backup/.last-backup` names the folder.

### Configuration / controls

- Schedule file: [config/schedule.json](config/schedule.json) with an automatic `schedule.backup.json`; `enabled`, `timezone`, per-program windows/content and `override`.
- Incident history: `data/health-state.json` (newest 200, atomic writes).
- New RPC: `schedule.get|update|program.update|override|auto|preview|test`, `health.get|check|retry|alerts.clear|export|audio`, `music.integrity|refresh`, `live.setReconnect|retryNow`.
- New broadcasts: `schedule.state`, `health.state`, `health.incident`, `audio.recover`, `music.integrity.updated`. New read-only `GET /api/diagnostics`.

