|---|---|
| Smoke suite on final code | **166/166 passed** |
| Schedule / reliability suite | **77/77 passed** |

Covered: all 7 timezones, DST spring-forward (08:00Z → 03:00 CDT), fall-back (07:30Z → 01:30 CST), midnight rollover, continuous-window edits, override/auto/preview, single-fire transitions; CPU/RAM/loop sustained thresholds; silent-audio raise/recover and false-positive prevention; missing/orphan/path-traversal music fixtures; **Piper worker killed mid-broadcast → auto-restarted after 2s, ready again, recovery counter incremented, pending speech not replayed**; duplicate TikTok connect ignored, failed lookup scheduled one retry, auto-reconnect off cancelled it; dashboard at 1440px with all panels rendering and **no console errors after a clean reload**.

